{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1046950-projectile-artifacts","id":1046950,"title":"Projectile Artifacts","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Mage: The Awakening"],"posts":[{"date":"2017-02-10T15:24:39-08:00","id":1046950,"title":"Projectile Artifacts","content":"Would it a be possible to make an Artifact that would shoot aimed spells with the speed of firearms/archery essentialy bypassing defense? It would be mechanicaly identical as the Fast Spells Merit.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12979-one-dawn","name":"One Dawn","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"15"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-10T16:15:51-08:00","id":1046972,"title":"","content":"Some things would still be able to dodge it, as there's bullet-dodgers aplenty in the world of darkness. But I don't see why not. Adamantine Arrow's book has a longbow artifact that shoots 'shafts of sunlight.'","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/886-nofather","name":"nofather","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar886_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11016"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-10T16:29:49-08:00","id":1046975,"title":"","content":"That's good to know but I was wondering what would the dots cost of replicating a Merit on an Artifact.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12979-one-dawn","name":"One Dawn","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"15"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-10T17:14:26-08:00","id":1046979,"title":"","content":"Given you'd only be able to use the merit on the spell(s) within the artifact I'd just cost it as being 1 dot more expensive after pricing all the spells involved.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6365-fumus","name":"Fumus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6365_2.gif","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jun 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"310"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-10T17:44:24-08:00","id":1046990,"title":"","content":"Thanks, I'll discuss this with my ST. Lastly, while the rule book shows the calculation of the Artifact based on the spell effect, it does not have anything regarding how the Gnosis of the Artifact is calculated. How does increasing Artifact's Gnosis affect the calculation?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/12979-one-dawn","name":"One Dawn","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2017"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"15"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2017-02-10T18:51:44-08:00","id":1047010,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>One Dawn</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/mage-the-awakening/1046950-projectile-artifacts?p=1046990#post1046990\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Thanks, I'll discuss this with my ST. Lastly, while the rule book shows the calculation of the Artifact based on the spell effect, it does not have anything regarding how the Gnosis of the Artifact is calculated. How does increasing Artifact's Gnosis affect the calculation?</div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;The item's effective Gnosis is equal to half the dot rating, rounded up.&quot; -p. 100, 3rd paragraph, 2nd line.<br /> <br /> So the rating determines the Gnosis, not the other way around.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/6770-midgardener","name":"Midgardener","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar6770_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jul 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"41"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}